more people, right?

00:33:59.303 --> 00:34:01.472
So like a lecture
with 500 people,

00:34:01.572 --> 00:34:02.707
very leveraged

00:34:02.707 --> 00:34:04.275
action of the lecture

00:34:04.275 --> 00:34:05.710
