00:35:00.064 --> 00:35:01.866
So I would say
that was a big one.

00:35:01.866 --> 00:35:02.900
The second one was,

00:35:02.900 --> 00:35:04.335
I think, just the evolution

00:35:04.335 --> 00:35:05.837
