00:35:23.387 --> 00:35:25.623
And so we just

00:35:25.623 --> 00:35:27.358
we tinkered over

00:35:27.358 --> 00:35:28.793
semesters of the best way

00:35:28.793 --> 00:35:30.361
to do a college and program.

00:35:30.361 --> 00:35:32.463
So the first time we did it,
we had ten ambassadors.

00:35:32.463 --> 00:35:33.898
We were super stringent

00:35:33.898 --> 00:35:34.966
who had the resumes,

00:35:34.966 --> 00:35:36.267
