00:36:32.557 --> 00:36:34.559
did you actually get human
interaction.

00:36:34.559 --> 00:36:35.193
Austin Right.

00:36:35.193 --> 00:36:36.394
And so it's just fine to

00:36:36.394 --> 00:36:37.595
like just iterate

00:36:37.595 --> 00:36:38.796
on this program over years.

00:36:39.931 --> 00:36:40.698
How did you actually

00:36:40.698 --> 00:36:42.567
