00:56:29.986 --> 00:56:31.521
Now that that's a reality,

00:56:31.521 --> 00:56:33.356
that can't
be part of my motivator.

00:56:35.191 --> 00:56:36.726
I would say also, I got very

00:56:36.726 --> 00:56:39.062
