00:56:47.404 --> 00:56:49.906
The intense paranoia,
by the way, is a staple

00:56:49.906 --> 00:56:51.908
of highly successful
and highly wealthy people.

00:56:52.041 --> 00:56:53.910
There's this weird paranoia

00:56:53.910 --> 00:56:55.111
