which is almost impossible

00:56:59.416 --> 00:57:00.850
if you unless
you royally screw something.

00:57:00.850 --> 00:57:02.352
Yeah, well,
I would say the big reason

00:57:02.352 --> 00:57:04.187
for me actually was because

00:57:04.187 --> 00:57:07.123
after moving out of the CEO
role for, I would say

00:57:07.123 --> 00:57:08.491
a period of 4 to 6 months,

00:57:08.491 --> 00:57:10.293
I was like very much

00:57:10.293 --> 00:57:11.461
not this existential

00:57:11.461 --> 00:57:13.396
or like cliche about like,
who am I?

00:57:13.396 --> 00:57:15.165
Who am I outside of
morning brew?

00:57:15.165 --> 00:57:17.167
I was not self loving at all
to myself.

00:57:17.167 --> 00:57:19.402
I question
what I was actually good at.

00:57:19.636 --> 00:57:20.703
So I think
a lot of that money

00:57:20.703 --> 00:57:23.306
anxiety was tied to me
being like,

00:57:23.573 --> 00:57:24.707
I don't know
if I'm ever going be able

00:57:24.707 --> 00:57:26.109
to create
something of value again,

00:57:26.109 --> 00:57:28.178
so I better not screw
this up

00:57:28.278 --> 00:57:30.180
and I better protect this
with my life

00:57:30.180 --> 00:57:31.080
because I don't know
if I'm going to

00:57:31.080 --> 00:57:32.282
bring anything else in

00:57:32.282 --> 00:57:34.717
that will add
on top of this,

00:57:34.717 --> 00:57:36.586
I think the greatest thing

00:57:36.586 --> 00:57:38.721
that it has done to increase
my happiness

00:57:38.755 --> 00:57:40.924
is give me
the freedom of time

00:57:41.224 --> 00:57:42.292
that I truly have

00:57:42.292 --> 00:57:43.726
the ability, like

00:57:43.726 --> 00:57:45.061
I don't set an alarm

00:57:45.061 --> 00:57:46.329
in the morning.

00:57:46.529 --> 00:57:47.797
My body just wakes me up

00:57:47.797 --> 00:57:49.766
like I can choose

00:57:49.766 --> 00:57:51.334
what to do with my time,

00:57:51.334 --> 00:57:52.502
both in morning brew

00:57:52.502 --> 00:57:54.270
