00:57:54.270 --> 00:57:55.672
And I see,
you know, for example,

00:57:55.672 --> 00:57:58.141
like how hard
those around me work

00:57:58.141 --> 00:57:59.709
in 9 to 5 jobs.

00:57:59.709 --> 00:58:00.944
And it's

00:58:02.712 --> 00:58:04.047
I just feel very grateful

00:58:04.047 --> 00:58:05.782
