what to do with my time.

00:58:05.782 --> 00:58:07.350
And I know that's
a cliche also,

00:58:07.350 --> 00:58:08.718
but that is
the number one thing.

00:58:08.718 --> 00:58:10.320
Sounds like I made
the wrong decision here.

00:58:10.320 --> 00:58:11.855
Sounds that sounds pretty

